# A plain prompt: claude answers and the turn finishes, as in
# tests/fixtures/claude-hooks/p-hello-*.log. One prompt.
agent claude-code
recording p-hello
timeout 120
expect finished

# Let claude draw its screen, then accept the trust dialog it shows for a folder it has not seen
# before: claude 2.1.306 lists `No, exit` first and selects it, so down, then Enter, picks `Yes, I
# trust this folder`. On claude's own prompt, down and Enter with nothing typed do nothing.
sleep 5
press down
press enter
wait-for SessionStart
sleep 2
type reply with the single word ok
press enter
wait-for Stop
